  "identifier": "The Minister for Foreign Affairs listed this entity on 4 December 2019 under regulation 6(1) of the Autonomous Sanctions Regulations 2011 (AS Regulations). (Note: This was a re-listing of a previous designation made by the Minister under regulation 6(1) of the AS Regulations that was in effect from 27 November 2013 to 2 December 2019.) Relisted on 3 December 2022.",
